invariant: INV-73
file: src/session.c
catches: tcp_nonblocking_loop_test
reason: tlsi_give_back_buf wipes all cfg.buf_len bytes again, the bytes
  past the mark among them, which hold the caller's own bytes. That is the
  cost docs/decisions.md 249 removed: on a host whose buffer is larger
  than its handshake, most of the wipe writes bytes no handshake wrote.
  The loop test requires a sentinel byte to survive past the wiped run.

--- old
    ct_wipe(t->cfg.buf, t->buf_written_len);
--- new
    ct_wipe(t->cfg.buf, t->cfg.buf_len);
